---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site title="Launch List Request | FilWest" description="What happens after requesting FilWest launch updates.">
  <main class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow">FilWest launch updates</p>
    <h1 class="heading-1 my-5">Thanks for your interest.</h1>
    <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">If you have just submitted our launch form successfully, we will use your email to let you know about launch and access availability. FilWest is not publicly launched, and joining the list does not create a dating account or guarantee a test invitation.</p>
    <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed mt-5">Visiting this page on its own does not subscribe you. To leave the list, email <a class="underline" href="mailto:support@filipinawest.com?subject=Remove%20me%20from%20the%20launch%20list">support@filipinawest.com</a>.</p>
    <a href="/guides" class="btn btn-primary mt-8">Explore our dating guides</a>
  </main>
</Site>
